  "translation": "Then the king’s scribes were summoned in the first month, on the thirteenth day in it, and all that Haman commanded was written to the satraps of the king, and to the governors who were over province and province, and to the princes of people and people — province by province according to its writing, and people by people according to its tongue — in the name of King Ahasuerus it was written and sealed with the signet ring of the king.",
